#ASSERT `s 25 the delivery or transfer has the same effect as if the person making it were a mercantile agent in possession with the consent of the owner` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25 the delivery or transfer has the same effect as if the person making it were a mercantile agent in possession with the consent of the owner` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25 the delivery or transfer has the same effect as if the person making it were a mercantile agent in possession with the consent of the owner` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 25 the delivery or transfer has the same effect as if the person making it were a mercantile agent in possession with the consent of the owner` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- notice of the seller's lien
